# Scan scratch: throwaway manifests, discovery/OSM dumps, scanlogs, one-off probe
# scripts. Dozens of these appear per scan session and none are inputs to the app.
# The ~47 manifests already tracked here stay tracked (gitignore doesn't untrack);
# to add a new deliberate one: git add -f workspace/<file>
workspace/

# Generated knowledge-graph output (~36MB, rebuilt by the graphify skill)
graphify-out/

# Dated pg_dump snapshots, e.g. dump-dealership_scanner-202607012302.sql
dump-*.sql

# Chroma master-catalog index: 12MB chroma.sqlite3 + 5MB data_level0.bin per
# collection, regenerated wholesale by backend/vector/ingest_master_specs.py.
# Dead weight since the pgvector migration — catalog_service.master_catalog_
# persist_dir() resolves to data/vectors/ and nothing reads this directory.
# NB it is only ~9MB of the 694MB .git, not the main cause: debug/ scanner
# failure PNGs are 141MB and backend/dictionary 31MB. Untrack those first if
# the goal is a smaller clone.
backend/vector/chroma_master_catalog/
